  description: Once a budding plant that has harnessed the essence of the Earth by
    enduring the immense pressure of rocks and soil after a landslide. After pushing
    their way out of the ground they glow in the purest green in the sunlight. A
    drop of essence from the Earth Bulb could revitalize dying plants and farmers
    often capture them for the goodsake of their crops.
